# Fleet runtime artifacts — the loop writes these to disk continuously and NEVER
# commits them (crash-only: authoritative state lives on disk, not in git). The
# seeds (STATE.json, OUTBOX.md, CRITERIA.md, STANDING_POLICY.json) stay tracked;
# their per-round mutation is expected runtime drift, not source.
fleet-ledger*.jsonl
fleet-heartbeat.json
*/ledger.jsonl
*/HANDOFF_NEXT.md
cronista/DIGEST.md
*.tmp
STOP
